    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0497" n="413" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg413"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. No. 763.72112/3475</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Rio de Janeiro</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gottschalk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-10T18:00:00-03:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 10, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.05 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Lloyd Brazileiro inquires whether its northbound shipping will be hindered
                    delivering cargo from German shippers in Brazil or to German consignees in our
                    country.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gottschalk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
